`bs1`) and `iov[1] = (s2, n2)` (the digits, `bs2`).  On this path the
`beqz`-empty short circuit at `0x8004cd8c` is NOT taken, the loop runs
exactly twice (count `2 → 1 → 0`, resid `n1+n2 → n2 → 0`), each iteration
